  "qualificationPolicy": "PowerChain 1.0.0 supports Node 22.22.3 compatibility, Node 24.18.1 LTS, and Node 26.5.1 Current with pnpm 10.21.0. Native macOS 11/12 uses Node 22; Node 24/26 official macOS binaries require macOS 13.5+. Any toolchain or approved-build change requires fresh Devnet qualification before Mainnet.",
